[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238230\">4450C10</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the front brake disc shield (1b)\nfrom the front vertical link.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017773.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the front brake disc shield\non the vertical link and secure it with its bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238230\">4450C10</a></p>"],[32,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in OFF\nposition, then disconnect the battery negative terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235042\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238032\">3310A30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238034\">3310A48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the front brake disc shield (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069900.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[32,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the front brake disc shield back\nin its housing and fix it using the bolts.</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238034\">3310A48</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238032\">3310A30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Top up the brake-clutch fluid level \n\n                                          <strong>- 0010T64 brake and or clutch fluid check level and top up\nas necessary</strong>\n                                           .</p><p>Bleed the air from the hydraulic braking\nsystem \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237416\">0010T65</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"]]